---
import SectionTitle from '../SectionTitle.astro';
---
<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionTitle eyebrow="Services">What I do</SectionTitle>

    <ol class="work-list">
      <li class="work-row reveal">
        <h3 class="work-name">Product Security &amp; DevSecOps</h3>
        <div class="work-body">
          <p>Automated security checks and secure defaults in the delivery pipeline.</p>
          <p class="work-tags mono">CI/CD · DevOps · Linux (Red Hat) · Secure Delivery</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="work-row reveal" style="--d:70ms">
        <h3 class="work-name">Application Security</h3>
        <div class="work-body">
          <p>Secure code review and testing alongside developers.</p>
          <p class="work-tags mono">Secure Code Review · Secure SDLC · JavaScript / Node.js · MongoDB</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="work-row reveal" style="--d:140ms">
        <h3 class="work-name">Web &amp; Mobile Penetration Testing</h3>
        <div class="work-body">
          <p>Web, API, and Android testing, with every finding verified and a clear fix.</p>
          <p class="work-tags mono">Web · Mobile · API · Red Teaming · Reporting</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="work-row reveal" style="--d:210ms">
        <h3 class="work-name">Security Research &amp; Bug Bounty</h3>
        <div class="work-body">
          <p>Finding vulnerabilities in live systems and disclosing them responsibly.</p>
          <p class="work-tags mono">Bug Bounty · Recon · Vulnerability Research · Disclosure</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="work-row reveal" style="--d:280ms">
        <h3 class="work-name">AI Security</h3>
        <div class="work-body">
          <p>Testing AI features for prompt injection, weak auth, and data exposure.</p>
          <p class="work-tags mono">LLM Applications · Authentication · Abuse Cases</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <div class="domains reveal">
      <p class="domains-head mono">Security domains I cover</p>
      <ul class="domains-list">
        <li>Product security</li>
        <li>Application security</li>
        <li>DevSecOps &amp; CI/CD</li>
        <li>API security</li>
        <li>Mobile security</li>
        <li>Cloud security (AWS)</li>
        <li>Kubernetes &amp; container security</li>
        <li>Infrastructure-as-Code security</li>
        <li>Software supply chain (SBOM, SLSA)</li>
        <li>Threat modeling</li>
        <li>AI security</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
